    """STEP6400 - PySpark Equivalent of BTEQ STEP6400
    
    Purpose:
        Inserts new records into NDW_XT.BIL_InputMethodType_Id_XT by calculating InputMethodType_Id using max value and row_number, 
        and filtering out existing Diary_Entry_Flag values.
    
    Summary of BTEQ Commands:
